    <td width="605" valign="top" style="width:453.55pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm">
    <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:15.0pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
    mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#666666"><br><br>Dear Agency
    Partner,<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"><br>We're pleased to provide your Agency access to Qantas
    Domestic Entertainment fares.<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"><br>Entertainment fares are net private fares available only to approved agents
    who specialise in servicing the entertainment industry, including film,
    television, music, theatre, and live touring.<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"><br>Please find attached our&nbsp;</span><i style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;">Qantas Domestic
    Entertainment fare clue card</i><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;">, where you will find information about our
    Domestic Entertainment fare product.<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"><br>If you have any questions or require further information, please reach out to your Qantas National Account Manager.<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"><br>Kind regards,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="tab-stops:111.0pt">
    <br>
    <b style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;">Qantas Agency Partnerships</b><br>
    <i style=""><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;">Qantas Airways Limited</span><span style="font-size: 14px;"><br></span></font></i><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><i><br></i></span></font><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
